text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures able to block Prized Unicorn do so.', "As Pithing Needle enters the battlefield, choose a card name.\nActivated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated unless they're mana abilities.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, choose target nonland permanent you control and up to two target nonland permanents you don't control. Destroy one of them at random.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.\n{T}: Tap all untapped Wolf creatures you control. Each Wolf tapped this way deals damage equal to its power to target creature. That creature deals damage equal to its power divided as its controller chooses among any number of those Wolves.', 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Berserkers of Blood Ridge attacks each combat if able.', 'Copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Counter target red or green spell.', 'Counter target spell.', 'Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token for each Forest you control.', 'Creatures you control gain haste until end of turn. (They can attack and {T} even if they just came under your control.)', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have flying.', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\nWhen Acidic Slime enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', "Defender\nWhenever Wall of Frost blocks a creature, that creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{B}: Regenerate Wall of Bone. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{R}: Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{W}: Wall of Faith gets +0/+1 until end of turn.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy all nonland permanents.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. You gain 4 life.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated. Its controller reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. The player puts that card onto the battlefield, then shuffles all other cards revealed this way into their library.", 'Destroy target green or white creature.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Dragonskull Summit enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Draw X cards.', 'Draw two cards.', "Dread Warlock can't be blocked except by black creatures.", 'Drowned Catacomb enters the battlefield tapped unless you control an Island or a Swamp.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Each opponent sacrifices a land.', 'Each player draws three cards, then discards three cards at random.', "Each player shuffles all permanents they own into their library, then reveals that many cards from the top of their library. Each player puts all artifact, creature, and land cards revealed this way onto the battlefield, then does the same for enchantment cards, then puts all cards revealed this way that weren't put onto the battlefield on the bottom of their library.", 'Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', "Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player loses 1 life.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.\nWhen enchanted creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, destroy Ice Cage.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Plains you control and has flying.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has lifelink. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Enchant land\nAs Convincing Mirage enters the battlefield, choose a basic land type.\nEnchanted land is the chosen type.', 'Enchant permanent\nEnchanted permanent has indestructible. (Effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy that permanent. A creature with indestructible can\'t be destroyed by damage.)', "Enchant tapped creature\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Equipped creature can't be blocked and has shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nEquip {2}", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has deathtouch. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy that creature.)\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+4 and loses flying.\nPrevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to equipped creature.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Exile all cards from target player's graveyard other than basic land cards. For each card exiled this way, search that player's library for all cards with the same name as that card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Exile target black or red permanent.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\nOther Soldier creatures you control have first strike.', "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\nProtection from black (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black.)", "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\nProtection from white (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything white.)", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\nWhenever Lightwielder Paladin deals combat damage to a player, you may exile target black or red permanent that player controls.', 'Flash\nFlying\nWhen Bogardan Hellkite enters the battlefield, it deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Flying', "Flying\nDjinn of Wishes enters the battlefield with three wish counters on it.\n{2}{U}{U}, Remove a wish counter from Djinn of Wishes: Reveal the top card of your library. You may play that card without paying its mana cost. If you don't, exile it.", 'Flying\nIf a source an opponent controls would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.', "Flying\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", 'Flying\nWhen Howling Banshee enters the battlefield, each player loses 3 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Illusionary Servant becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it.', 'Flying\nWhen Magma Phoenix dies, it deals 3 damage to each creature and each player.\n{3}{R}{R}: Return Magma Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\nWhen Sage Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\nWhenever Hypnotic Specter deals damage to an opponent, that player discards a card at random.', "Flying\nWhenever Sphinx Ambassador deals combat damage to a player, search that player's library for a card, then that player chooses a card name. If you searched for a creature card that doesn't have that name, you may put it onto the battlefield under your control. Then that player shuffles.", "Flying\nYou can't lose the game and your opponents can't win the game.", 'Flying\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If this ability has been activated four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Flying\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying, first strike, lifelink, protection from Demons and from Dragons', "Flying, trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a creature other than Xathrid Demon, then each opponent loses life equal to the sacrificed creature's power. If you can't sacrifice a creature, tap Xathrid Demon and you lose 7 life.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Glacial Fortress enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Plains or an Island.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nOther Goblin creatures you control get +1/+1 and have haste.', 'Ignite Disorder deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target white and/or blue creatures.', "Jackal Familiar can't attack or block alone.", 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Lifelink', 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order. You may shuffle.\nDraw a card.', 'Other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\n{T}: Add {G} for each Elf you control.', "Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1.\n{T}: Target Merfolk creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Other Soldier creatures you control get +0/+1.', 'Other Soldier creatures you control get +1/+0.', 'Other Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\n{2}{B}, {T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Palace Guard can block any number of creatures.', "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\nAs long as the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus and other Vampire creatures you control get +2/+1 and have flying.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.', 'Protean Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\nIf damage would be dealt to Protean Hydra, prevent that damage and remove that many +1/+1 counters from it.\nWhenever a +1/+1 counter is removed from Protean Hydra, put two +1/+1 counters on it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', "Regenerate target creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Relentless Rats gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield named Relentless Rats.\nA deck can have any number of cards named Relentless Rats.', "Return all artifact and enchantment cards from all graveyards to the battlefield under their owners' control. (Auras with nothing to enchant remain in graveyards.)", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Rootbound Crag enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain or a Forest.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Vampire Aristocrat gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for an artifact card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Seismic Strike deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', "Serpent of the Endless Sea's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Islands you control.\nSerpent of the Endless Sea can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Spend only black mana on X.\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', 'Sunpetal Grove enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Forest or a Plains.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Tap all creatures target player controls. Those creatures don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Target blocking creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -7/-0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards X cards at random.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Target player mills five cards.', 'Target player mills half their library, rounded down.', 'Target player takes an extra turn after this one.', 'Tendrils of Corruption deals X damage to target creature and you gain X life, where X is the number of Swamps you control.', 'The next 2 damage that a source of your choice would deal to you and/or permanents you control this turn is dealt to any target instead.', "This spell can't be countered.\nProtection from blue and from black (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything blue or black.)", 'This spell costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\nFireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among any number of targets.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\nHaste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Ball Lightning.", "Trample, indestructible\nIf Darksteel Colossus would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal Darksteel Colossus and shuffle it into its owner's library instead.", "Up to three target creatures can't block this turn.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\nOther Soldier creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.\nWhen Captain of the Watch enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.", "When Awakener Druid enters the battlefield, target Forest becomes a 4/5 green Treefolk creature for as long as Awakener Druid remains on the battlefield. It's still a land.", 'When Borderland Ranger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Sparkmage Apprentice enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Whenever Bramble Creeper attacks, it gets +5/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Inferno Elemental blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Inferno Elemental deals 3 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a blue spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a green spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a white spell, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, each other player copies that spell. Each of those players may choose new targets for their copy.', 'Whenever a player taps a land for mana, Manabarbs deals 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a blue or black spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Mold Adder.', "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, you may put that card on the bottom of your library.", 'Whenever an opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, Underworld Dreams deals 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.', 'White creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Windstorm deals X damage to each creature with flying.', 'You gain 1 life for each land you control.', 'You gain 7 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.', 'You may have Clone enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield.', "Your opponents can't cast spells this turn.", 'Your opponents play with their hands revealed.', "[+1]: Chandra Nalaar deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\n[−X]: Chandra Nalaar deals X damage to target creature.\n[−8]: Chandra Nalaar deals 10 damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", '[+1]: Target player discards a card.\n[−2]: Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top.\n[−8]: Put all creature cards from all graveyards onto the battlefield under your control.', '[+1]: Untap two target lands.\n[−1]: Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\n[−4]: Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', '[+1]: You gain 2 life.\n[−1]: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control. Those creatures gain vigilance until end of turn.\n[−6]: Create a white Avatar creature token. It has "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to your life total."', '[+2]: Each player draws a card.\n[−1]: Target player draws a card.\n[−10]: Target player mills twenty cards.', '{1}{B}, {T}: Target player loses 1 life.', '{1}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token.', '{3}, {T}: Rod of Ruin deals 1 damage to any target.', '{B}: Looming Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", '{G}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', "{G}: Regenerate Cudgel Troll. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", '{R}: Fiery Hellhound gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Mirror of Fate: Choose up to seven face-up exiled cards you own. Exile all the cards from your library, then put the chosen cards on top of your library.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Gargoyle Castle: Create a 3/4 colorless Gargoyle artifact creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Destroy target tapped creature.', '{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{T}: Goblin Artillery deals 2 damage to any target and 3 damage to you.', '{T}: Prodigal Pyromancer deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Target creature an opponent controls attacks you this turn if able.', "{T}: Target creature you control with toughness less than Stone Giant's power gains flying until end of turn. Destroy that creature at the beginning of the next end step.", '{W}, {T}: Exile target Skeleton, Vampire, or Zombie.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
